  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support to the Eastern Partnership Transport Panel - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides assistance aimed at strengthening the regional transport connectivity in the Eastern Partnership region and fulfils a secretariat function for the Eastern Partnership Transport Panel. It supports: (i) an ongoing update of the TEN-T Investment Action Plan; (ii) corridor definition and impact measurement; (iii) improvement of corridor performance and focus on digital development; (iv) establishment of EaP Road Safety Observatory and assistance to regional WGs on Road Safety.</narrative>
  </description>
